@title Route all: a wire no duct reaches is marked and listed, not drawn straight
@area Cabinet
# Fixture: the example after Place all with the vertical trunk cut short, so only the first two row ducts join. Wires below them have no duct path: red rings at their terminals in the plate, a note in the Routes panel, and Issues lists them.
open qa/fixtures/route-no-duct-path.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Route all wires
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
shot plate-and-routes
check_layout
check_blank plate-and-routes
click_text "warnings"
wait 10
shot issues
check_layout
